@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
actor "Охранник" as Guard
participant "Мобильное приложение Android/iOS" as Mobile
participant "PHP API" as API
participant "OTP Adapter" as OTP
database "MySQL" as DB
Guard -> Mobile: Ввод телефона
Mobile -> API: POST /auth/otp/request
API -> OTP: Отправить код
OTP --> API: provider_message_id
API --> Mobile: challenge_id
Guard -> Mobile: Ввод OTP
Mobile -> API: POST /auth/otp/verify
API -> DB: Проверить challenge / user / tenant
API -> DB: Создать AuthSession (token_hash)
API --> Mobile: access/refresh token
@enduml
